      "description": "<p>Santiago Peña was detained minutes after he was impeached by Congress, as protesters took to the streets demanding answers after the suspension of the Ueno bank</p><p>Paraguay’s rightwing president has been placed under house arrest minutes after he was impeached by Congress, amid a severe crisis that left more than half the country’s population unable to access their bank accounts.</p><p>Santiago Peña is being investigated about allegations he used his political influence to favour a bank that expanded exponentially under his government and was <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/05/paraguay-president-santiago-pena-resigns\">suspended this week after irregularities</a>.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/07/ousted-paraguay-president-under-house-arrest-after-banking-crisis-leaves-60-of-country-unable-to-access-accounts\">Continue reading...</a>",
